 6. 🗽 Trump heads to New York 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 New York Mayor Zohran Mamdani passes former Mayor Rudy Giuliani at a ceremony this month commemorating the 25th anniversary of the 9/11 attacks. Photo: Barry Williams/The Daily News via AP President Trump will visit New York Mayor Zohran Mamdani at his official residence, Gracie Mansion, this afternoon.

 They'll "focus on issues affecting New York City and New Yorkers," a spokesperson for the mayor's office told the N.Y. Times . Trump will be in Manhattan for the UN General Assembly, where he'll speak tomorrow. Tonight, he'll headline two Republican donor events — an RNC reception and a MAGA Inc. dinner.

 The president will meet with Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky on the UNGA sidelines. The meeting comes as the White House works to broker an agreement between Russia and Ukraine to de-escalate and resume talks, Axios' Barak Ravid reports . 
 
